{"4364230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Idiom Royale", "steam_appid": 4364230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When idioms meet a brutal multiplayer battle royale, your vocabulary is your only weapon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idiom Royale</strong> is a high-stakes word battle royale where <strong>20–40 players</strong> clash in deadly idiom challenges. Crack the idiom puzzles to live. Fail, and you’ll lose a finger—or face Russian roulette. In the end, <strong>only one survives</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Reactions. Perfect Spelling.</strong><br>Go head-to-head in intense <strong>1v1 duels</strong> where every word matters. Fail to solve the idiom in time, and you pay the price. <strong>Only one advances</strong> to the next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Losers Are Punished</strong><br>Failure has consequences—lose a finger or be executed. Track your progress and see where you stand in this ruthless word duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idiom Battle Royale</strong><br>Survive a lethal idiom showdown as <strong>40 players</strong> race to crack the code. Every mistake brings you closer to elimination—and worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race Against the Clock</strong><br>Solve the idiom faster than everyone else, or face the consequences. Each error pushes you one step closer to losing a finger—or your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Mayhem</strong><br>Join massive <strong>40-player</strong> rooms or challenge friends in private matches. Outsmart and outpace your rivals to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type fast. Guess right. Do you have what it takes to be the last survivor?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When idioms meet a brutal multiplayer battle royale, your vocabulary is your only weapon.</strong></p><p class=